      "message": "in this case, `ForegroundServiceDidNotStartInTimeException` happens.. because `ACTION_SHUTDOWN_VM` is used for startForegroundService. I\u0027m taking a look at that weird issue now..\n\nBTW, I think either is okay, isn\u0027t it?",
