      "writtenOn": "2025-03-19T15:54:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "that\u0027s odd. we don\u0027t call `startForegroundService` but call `stopForeground` upon ACTION_SHUTDOWN_VM.\n\nthenAcceptAsync is an odd choice because it will execute this function in the forkjoin pool.",
      "parentUuid": "5848dca1_8fc9cf4a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 395,
        "startChar": 38,
        "endLine": 395,
